<title>GERMANY: Gildemeister says turned to profit in 96.</title>
<headline>Gildemeister says turned to profit in 96.</headline>
<dateline>BIELEFELD, Germany 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   7.7     vs 22.9 loss</p>
<p>    Group earnings from ord. activities  1.3     vs 13.4 loss</p>
<p>    Group sales				  828.1   vs 745.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German machine tool group is Gildemeister AG. The company attributed the improvement in its earnings to measures to optimise earnings and sales that were introduced in the second half of 1996. The group said it expected the improvement in earnings to continue this year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
